id: 31
hanzi: 全神贯注
pinyin: quán shén guàn zhù
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Idiom

meanings_summary:
  en: to concentrate with undivided attention; to be completely absorbed or engrossed
  es: concentrarse en cuerpo y alma; estar absorto; prestar atención total y exclusiva

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Idiom | Standard | focusing all of one's mental energy, spirit, and faculties on a single task without the slightest distraction | concentrar toda la energía anímica, espíritu y atención en una sola labor sin distracción alguna | 全神贯注地听讲 (listen with rapt attention)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 李广将军扎稳马步，屏住呼吸，全神贯注地凝视着草丛中的猛虎，拉满弓弦蓄势待发。 | Lǐ Guǎng jiāngjūn zhāwěn mǎbù, bǐngzhù hūxī, quánshén-guànzhù de níngshì zhe cǎocóng zhōng de měnghǔ, lāmǎn gōngxián xùshì-dàifā. | General Li Guang planted his stance, held his breath, and gazed at the tiger in the grass with undivided focus, drawing his bow taut. | El general Li Guang afianzó su postura, contuvo el aliento y clavó la vista en el tigre con concentración absoluta, tensando el arco al límite.
  #2 | 外科手术台上，主刀医生全神贯注地操作着微创显微仪器，长达八小时未曾有丝毫懈怠。 | Wàikē shǒushùtái shàng, zhǔdāo yīshēng quánshén-guànzhù de cāozuò zhe wēichuàng xiǎnwēi yíqì, chángdá bā xiǎoshí wèicéng yǒu sīháo xièdài. | Over the operating table, the chief surgeon operated micro-instruments with undivided attention, never slacking for eight straight hours. | Sobre la mesa de operaciones, el cirujano jefe manejaba los instrumentos microscópicos con concentración total, sin un instante de fatiga durante ocho horas.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  全神贯注地看书 | read a book with undivided attention
  全神贯注地倾听 | listen with rapt attention
  全神贯注于工作 | completely absorbed in work
  保持全神贯注 | maintain total focus and concentration
  全神贯注的神态 | expression of intense absorption
  瞬间全神贯注 | instantly focused with undivided mind

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  聚精会神 | jù jīng huì shén | gather one's spirit and thoughts; concentrate intensely
  专心致志 | zhuān xīn zhì zhì | devote oneself heart and soul; dedicated focus
  目不转睛 | mù bù zhuǎn jīng | gaze with fixed eyes without blinking
  心无旁骛 | xīn wú páng wù | heart free of worldly distractions; completely dedicated

character_decomposition[4]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  全 | quán | whole; entire; complete; total | todo; entero; completo; total | 入 | enter | 入 (enter / shelter) | 王 (wáng, precious jade ingot) | 6 | 上下结构 | Ancient pictogram of pure, unblemished jade entered beneath a sheltering roof, meaning flawless and complete. | Pure, flawless jade stored under a roof preserves its entire, complete perfection (全). | Una gema de jade puro guardada bajo techado conserva su integridad entera y cabal (全). | 35 | OMG | 
  神 | shén | spirit; soul; mind; deity | espíritu; alma; mente; divinidad | 礻 | spirit / ritual | 礻 (altar, divine revelation) | 申 (shēn, lightning bolt / expansion) | 9 | 左右结构 | Ancient bronze pictogram of celestial lightning 申 flashing beside a ritual altar 礻, signifying spiritual energy and consciousness. | Heavenly lightning (申) descends upon the sacred altar (礻) to awaken divine spirit and focus (神). | El rayo celestial (申) desciende sobre el ara sagrada (礻) iluminando la chispa del espíritu (神). | 35 | IFSL | 
  贯 | guàn | pierce; string together; run through | atravesar; ensartar; hilvanar | 贝 | shell / currency | 毌 (guàn, piercing cord) | 贝 (bèi, cowrie coin / treasure) | 8 | 上下结构 | Simplified from 貫. Ancient pictogram showing a cord 毌 piercing through cowrie shell currency 贝 to bind them in one line. | A cord pierces right through the center of valuable coins (贝) to string them together into one unified line (贯). | Una cuerda atraviesa el centro de monedas valiosas (贝) ensartándolas en un solo hilo continuo (贯). | 51 | WBO | 貫
  注 | zhù | pour; concentrate; annotate; inject | verter; concentrar; fijar; inyectar | 氵 | water | 氵 (water stream flowing) | 主 (zhǔ, flame lamp wick / master) | 8 | 左右结构 | Phono-semantic compound: water 氵 flowing decisively toward the lamp wick 主, signifying pouring water or pouring mental energy into one focus. | Pouring water (氵) with steady precision directly onto the master wick (主) focuses all flow into one point (注). | Verter agua (氵) con pulso certero sobre la mecha maestra (主) concentra toda la energía en un solo foco (注). | 51 | EYG | 

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: Pouring (注) your entire, complete (全) spiritual mind (神) like a cord strung through an arrow (贯) achieves undivided concentration (全神贯注).
  composite_memory_hook_es: Verter (注) todo (全) el espíritu (神) como un hilo tenaz que lo atraviesa (贯) cristaliza la concentración total (全神贯注).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: In ancient Chinese archery lore (射艺), as described in Liezi (列子) and Zhuangzi, marksmanship was not merely physical exertion but a meditative trance of 'unifying spirit' (凝神). When concentration achieves absolute unity, arrows can pierce solid stone.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: Rising, rising, falling, falling: 'quán shén guàn zhù' (35-35-51-51). Lift smoothly across the first two syllables, then strike down emphatically on the final two.

