semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 全神贯注 describes the psychological state where 100% of conscious mental energy is channeled into a single target.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 全神贯注 vs. 专心致志 | zhuānxīn-zhìzhì | Both mean concentrating, but 全神贯注 highlights the intense physiological absorption of senses and mental faculties at a single moment, whereas 专心致志 highlights long-term dedication to a craft or study.
    2 | 全神贯注 vs. 聚精会神 | jùjīng-huìshén | Highly synonymous; 聚精会神 emphasizes gathering dispersed energy together, while 全神贯注 emphasizes pouring that gathered energy outward like a focused beam into an object.
    3 | 全神贯注 vs. 目不转睛 | mùbù-zhuǎnjīng | 目不转睛 describes solely the fixed optical gaze of the physical eyes without blinking, whereas 全神贯注 describes the entire mind, spirit, and awareness.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 静谧的书斋里，老画家屏息凝神，全神贯注地落下了长卷上的最后一笔。案头那一方墨砚早已干涸，窗外的夜色不知何时已然深沉。这种沉醉于艺术创作的忘我境界，让心灵彻底脱离了世俗的羁绊与尘劳。 | Jìngmì de shūzhāi lǐ, lǎo huàjiā bǐngxī-níngshén, quánshén-guànzhù de luòxià le chángjuàn shàng de zuìhòu yì bǐ. Àntóu nà yì fāng mòyàn zǎoyǐ gānhé, chuāngwài de yèsè bùzhī héshí yǐrán shēnchén. Zhè zhǒng chénzuì yú yìshù chuàngzuò de wàngwǒ jìngjiè, ràng xīnlíng chèdǐ tuōlí le shìsú de jībàn yǔ chénláo. | In the serene studio, the veteran painter held his breath, executing the final stroke with rapt attention. The inkstone on the desk had long dried, and night had fallen outside. This selfless immersion in creation freed his soul from worldly shackles. | En el sosegado estudio, el veterano pintor contuvo el aliento y trazó la última pincelada con entrega absoluta. La tintero del pupitre se había secado y la noche envolvía ya el ventanal; tal comunión creadora liberó su alma de toda atadura mundana.
  #2 | 在重大科研攻关的紧要关头，全神贯注的专注力往往是激发颠覆性灵感的决定性催化剂。科研团队在长达数周的高强度推演中心无旁骛，排除外界的一切干扰，终于在海量复杂数据中捕捉到了那一丝转瞬即逝的关键规律。 | Zài zhòngdà kēyán gōngguān de jǐnyào guāntóu, quánshén-guànzhù de zhuānzhùlì wǎngwǎng shì jīfā diānfùxìng línggǎn de juédìngxìng cuīhuàjì. Kēyán tuánduì zài chángdá shù zhōu de gāoxiàngdù tuīyǎn zhōng xīnwú-pángwù, páichú wàijiè de yíqiè gānrǎo, zhōngyú zài hǎiliàng fùzá shùjù zhōng bǔzhuō dào le nà yì sī zhuǎnshùn-jíshì de guānjiàn guīlǜ. | At critical research junctures, undivided concentration catalyses disruptive breakthroughs. Filtering out external interference through weeks of high-intensity derivation, the team finally captured the fleeting key law hidden inside complex datasets. | En la hora decisiva de la investigación puntera, la atención sin fisuras es el catalizador que desata hallazgos revolucionarios. El equipo científico, ajeno a toda distracción en semanas de ardua labor, logró aislar la esquiva clave oculta en los datos.
